ouch input via Origami’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"origami.Drag","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" patch, which wires its","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"output "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Position"},{"type":"text","text":" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card snaps back to its resting position."}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/onScrollPhaseChange(_:)-3qhn5":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"onScrollPhaseChange","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"((","kind":"text"},{"text":"ScrollPhase","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI11ScrollPhaseO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ScrollPhase","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI11ScrollPhaseO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"View"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/onScrollPhaseChange(_:)-3qhn5","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/onscrollphasechange(_:)-3qhn5","title":"onScrollPhaseChange(_:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"title":"Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","type":"topic","role":"collection","kind":"symbol"}}}